<title>UK: Dt Ausgleischbank adds 500 mln marks to 2006 bond.</title>
<headline>Dt Ausgleischbank adds 500 mln marks to 2006 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was has been increased by joint lead managers Trinkaus &amp; Burkhardt, Bayerische Vereinsbank AG, Commerzbank, Dresdner and DG Bank.  BORROWER   DEUTSCHE AUSGLEISCHBANK</p>
<p> AMT    *1.5 BLN DEM  COUPON     6.50	MATURITY    29.MAY.06</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  103.355   PAY DATE  **29.MOV.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  32.5 BP   REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	 =</p>
<p> NOTES    *LAUNCHED ON 20.MAY.96. INCREASED BY 500 MILLION MARKS</p>
<p>	   **PLUS ACCRUED INTEREST.</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    DUSS,FURT  PAY FREQ   =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 GOV LAW    GERMAN     HOME CTRY  =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    10 BP     SELL CONC  22.5 BP    PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
